{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"064b753fb5172d4815b413b05a26aea3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## iTerm2 DynamicProfiles\n\n**存放路径**\n\n```bash\nls ~/Library/Application\\ Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles/\n```\n\n若无此目录说明从未用过 DynamicProfiles 功能。\n\n**JSON 顶层必填字段**\n\n```bash\njq 'keys' ~/Library/Application\\ Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles/*.json\n```\n\n必填键：`Name`（字符串）、`Guid`（字符串）。此外颜色定义在 `Colors` 对象下，常见子键如 `Background Color`、`Foreground Color` 等。\n\n**同名 Profile 是否覆盖**\n\n**会覆盖**。iTerm2 以 `Name` 为唯一标识符加载 DynamicProfiles——若动态配置里某 `Name` 与用户已存在的命名 Profile 重名，系统会优先使用动态版本。验证方式：\n\n```bash\n# 列出所有 Profile 名称（动态+静态）\ndefaults read com.googlecode.iterm2 \"Custom Color Presets\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"no overrides\"\n```\n\n更直接的方式：打开 iTerm2 → Preferences → Profiles，随便选一个 Profile，按 `⌘E` 打开 JSON 编辑器，看左侧列表中是否有两份同名的 Profile——动态的那份旁会有 🔄 或 dynamic 标记。"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":159,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26942,"cache_read_input_tokens":20205},"service_tier":"standard","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d6531f86-78a4-4bf1-89e0-26a2c23a4c48","uuid":"06e368f7-70b1-4d89-bad2-06eda084dc19"}
