{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":46318,"duration_api_ms":24673,"num_turns":2,"result":"## iTerm2 DynamicProfiles\n\n**存放路径**\n\n```bash\nls ~/Library/Application\\ Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles/\n```\n\n若无此目录说明从未用过 DynamicProfiles 功能。\n\n**JSON 顶层必填字段**\n\n```bash\njq 'keys' ~/Library/Application\\ Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles/*.json\n```\n\n必填键：`Name`（字符串）、`Guid`（字符串）。此外颜色定义在 `Colors` 对象下，常见子键如 `Background Color`、`Foreground Color` 等。\n\n**同名 Profile 是否覆盖**\n\n**会覆盖**。iTerm2 以 `Name` 为唯一标识符加载 DynamicProfiles——若动态配置里某 `Name` 与用户已存在的命名 Profile 重名，系统会优先使用动态版本。验证方式：\n\n```bash\n# 列出所有 Profile 名称（动态+静态）\ndefaults read com.googlecode.iterm2 \"Custom Color Presets\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"no overrides\"\n```\n\n更直接的方式：打开 iTerm2 → Preferences → Profiles，随便选一个 Profile，按 `⌘E` 打开 JSON 编辑器，看左侧列表中是否有两份同名的 Profile——动态的那份旁会有 🔄 或 dynamic 标记。\n\n<self-report>\npremature_stopping: false\npermission_seeking: false\nownership_dodging: false\nsimplest_fix: false\nreasoning_loop: false\nknown_limitation: false\nskipped_repo_search: false\nfabricated_value: false\nplaceholder_used: false\nambiguity_unresolved: false\ncontradiction_unresolved: false\nsilent_fallback: false\n</self-report>","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d6531f86-78a4-4bf1-89e0-26a2c23a4c48","total_cost_usd":0.35680775,"usage":{"input_tokens":318,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48925,"cache_read_input_tokens":45873,"output_tokens":1060,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed":{"inputTokens":318,"outputTokens":1060,"cacheReadInputTokens":45873,"cacheCreationInputTokens":48925,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.35680775,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":